{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5202f870a5ea6d35eabe75f8bfa703d7df3bb4019520048d00f8c38abe3a9426",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ceb0510d3ad95ed4bf233b7cf535f90f1a5a954f7cfd2236fe71f8370032d54",
      "text": "重塑自我的话语",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bfde331db90a6501be65c8f454ddf57a28ae74296d5a7e061c6343c7cf31424",
      "text": "某个休息日。遵守着制作人的嘱咐，\n百百人正打算把时间花在自己身上。\n但他却完全想不到该做些什么。\n就在此时，被塞在房间深处的某样东西，\n映入了他的眼帘。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ceb0510d3ad95ed4bf233b7cf535f90f1a5a954f7cfd2236fe71f8370032d54",
      "text": "重塑自我的话语",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9c283c5e8165e010db791b5b9f074aa39c26d00e0a5f01575acd06ab424022d",
      "text": "（嗯……已经这个时间了……\n啊，不过，今天……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:081aa19f879c1ec2f418ba605194ca74f96e88437047564c8e9c03abc7cd92d2",
      "text": "关于明天的工作，\n因为对方的安排而改期了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d42acd5424bd849ee8d2121a67f04d0760741c4d29a8682e69c39603a7e03d37",
      "text": "百百人先生。请不要来事务所，也不要自主练习，\n把时间留给自己去放松吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ec4e743d48fb5be3b393d18399e49bdf0da99acc8740717cf3f3f58a07e99fe",
      "text": "对了，今天放假了。\n……本来，应该能见面的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e54003546e5b581ee0d7562ebe7d170c72e54978fd0a32f902691f5739ab30ba",
      "text": "（既然P酱这么说了，我也想照做）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_a:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50ac94a3f45d8da53765288eb8ea8887d053f7b9aaf1f9a0866cdcbd224fe93e",
      "text": "“为了自己”什么的……\n究竟该做些什么才好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_a:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afd9a5eb0472eb0b99eabe3e10fe950a711f142befcba451861256ded837efba",
      "text": "（去买东西……？\n但是，现在也没有想要的东西）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_a:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adeaf5822ad451cea577cceef852fceba25b09df37c491e791242a2bda86bb4c",
      "text": "（朋友的话只要约了应该会来……\n但现在没有想见人的心情啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_a:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:719da22c98b9939d02e8d15afab7b7b2232dab6d8e5ec5331a369324f9edbc67",
      "text": "（家里的事也是，吃饭有送来的便当，\n大部分家务也都有家政人员来做）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_a:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:328378ed8203ac14d89d5cc0d1ffdecd77471a4dbe5d521d8d5a5ee34ab7e7e7",
      "text": "脑子里……完全是一片空白呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f7f3e04945c1db33cd0727914ffa9d37124af00363a1e471666123ea024b838",
      "text": "（见不到P酱的话，就无事可做了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a27ecb64953f72b632b5dc7c32152e9e0bd78fc7a581fd6ee0b8fc921d16caa2",
      "text": "……算了，再睡个回笼觉吧。\n好让明天快点到来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d33cc09c22fb655296d9589131cac9887e420643716c4dddfa2f721b8194b88",
      "text": "（……啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbcdc52672534924f77027fa1570e16a33d72892affff09d32d461d4a44cfc40",
      "text": "（啊啊，看到了。\n塞在房间深处的，那个……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee9ed1147bb7a80ebb3997f0e99ee6514e67472341ba889d13b0513667fd5053",
      "text": "（画到一半的、我的画）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92dd5806d882272694d71e3cc37dacb3d0cdc3acdd9b44dbb80a7c595f2c80e9",
      "text": "（真讨厌。每次看到那个，总是会……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6f7e49d4164b65b6bdcde2787d335edffec41e5ab79fc155424b98599f388cf",
      "text": "……奇怪？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_b:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c485f5656ba19b35741bb97661978ac8d224b69e0ef57dafc7d4a5cfb509785",
      "text": "（为什么呢。今天居然听不到“那个声音”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_b:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8255cbc19d66d98d8e3e7c1dc4e03228ac727eaf7e50a308bee61d7b8667d404",
      "text": "……难道说，换作现在的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f63f54b3d5f74299bf4a1bbb9f7835c50968f035c5c694ec8d05f7120674d240",
      "text": "（画布的触感，颜料的气味。\n好久没感受到了啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d2b9f93a72ff59ce0398bcf91300653f826179cb484aaaaa77df551fcc3e2c6",
      "text": "（这幅画，我原本是打算挑战\n一种新的涂色方式的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2aba358c3edad243aa12d08afac1d085ec1d134cb603af2d756c0fdf835fe979",
      "text": "（然后，这一次一定要……让妈妈……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b458b1cb874ce1bd4067ded3dbccacf8771c8c77df617aa8cc55c61c7ffe3f4",
      "text": "……啊啊。果然还是想起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d1e5c60bbaaa7b150c314ed7da3e385d607dfdc0bc241ff0515c42084be51b1",
      "text": "之前那个绘画比赛，又是入围奖吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_c:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adeaa743d44d8e74ca64d188c32974557fb9d18dbba9c99649724d2d5c0aaa32",
      "text": "啊……嗯。\n但是呢，妈妈。下一次我很有信心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e10bc2bbd670df866da6e2f4508f7e09268ddf7c7b89f41fb42437238879c069",
      "text": "你看，之前给你看过的，那幅画。\n在那幅画里，我有些想要尝试的新画法……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d21c3662e2d42a50892e619266b60c32970afb6a02b242026c9257c8b6015f0",
      "text": "不，没关系的百百人。\n无论你再怎么做，你的画都已经不行了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_c:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0ac46555954c27f77aeb80db2a0d36c5361b004fbd24c1983a6fa5607e44900",
      "text": "这一次换一件能够好好拿第一名的、\n别的事情来试试吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:113b2214d703f97922b106b4013f2c72bfd8aa5a8bc87e4cf8efef009389f0b6",
      "text": "……嗯。我知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1402e70a14c436b2c95df22024fe0ff732b5b91b18bee254e4a43ddb30e28ee",
      "text": "（……其实，我是喜欢画画的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1d159e18279b6bea2c5aed2ec33f22f8e3d410905cc527f370e1d7b6ef30313",
      "text": "（虽然爸爸和妈妈，\n都不期许这样的我）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef602b0b6fe13a6c80f8e7f64916eb276b60e4e568331e90fe655f2a00199072",
      "text": "（但无论如何都舍不得扔掉，\n就一直收在房间的深处）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aebdae3cee44e4f3c1a5081c589ee7a548608679fe9426ca5b2dec8fedfeb43c",
      "text": "（因为在这个地方，谁也不会进来……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d6cb745d496a82e913c3ef46211c1438a616727c17ec09e498fdff3e3ef0d4d",
      "text": "……我的画。真的有那么差劲，吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a30729e941ce5850a0f86a64275982078d17a8d1beff387802ab9098384343e",
      "text": "（可是，P酱却……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a75e27988dd830f916baf89f803191aca443a0d07daf1aa25a26a23cc4d81a55",
      "text": "不，这是非常了不起的才能！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:549f2641715b598489a3c000b09174d5c907cd90fba38b577021a30e2d836eec",
      "text": "百百人先生不是一直以来，\n都付出了100%的努力吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7b3010cbe86229ad291c164e080f6bd2f46279a73285d1a35f72d5e3d66e16a",
      "text": "这可不是谁都能轻易做到的事情，\n光是这一点就已经拿到满分100分了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8519cc102be7c6a0e615c25f41aa9754eab94beeebe5043fe221d8cc88037ef",
      "text": "……为什么呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_d:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31492d9ddf98caeae6f39f59afc93582bc89a63971a93130384b593c31729983",
      "text": "现在比起“那个声音”，\nP酱的话语听得更清楚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:989891ee4292e39286d37a372acca6701c8351038be452602850fce9379c9914",
      "text": "或许……这幅画也是有，\n值得夸奖的优点的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:912f5a02e2129e53d214c5637835f6ee7d78dcf25863cdb8ea462068e198e53b",
      "text": "（什么嘛，不过是自己想这么认为罢了。\n顺从私心地，依赖着P酱的话语）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8049ed6d5f4a3939f2bf0d5f13a62745a85254c4fc60e9e4a55d2abc39b0b07",
      "text": "（即使如此……现在的我，还是想画完这幅画）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2cd6630854942e936dab400915c3f9ac7bed5c72ab60c9d2d3107deda07d31a",
      "text": "……一直把你扔在这种地方，\n对不起啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_e:cmd-000088:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "次日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:419f6ecfe50ab3cb7c45dc65e8bed4b0124023cd1983e68579eca4dff6eac1c8",
      "text": "早上好，●●●●●●●●●●P酱。\n今天能见到你真开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_e:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7718d741005442732e61596bc11928667e857317cc348e1a236ab8076f89e94c",
      "text": "百百人先生，早上好！\n昨天休息得还好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_e:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01fa312d07f149a2ed4c31d539bb541b04c92f779b9473d5fcf0a449db072138",
      "text": "嗯。就像P酱说的那样，\n我好好地把时间用在自己身上了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_e:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aed3dab5ab7dca8960a27cfa49b28a2b92f5b7ad1c59b864bc1bc184a5585b45",
      "text": "所以呢，下次要是再放假的话……\n你能来我家吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_048mom_01_1_2_048_01:1_2_048_01_e:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a40b17d7e4322df5e7afb3703e4637ed3ca77af0dd6927b114e246bd11fd6cf9",
      "text": "虽然心里有点忐忑……\n但我有件东西想让你看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
